Notice of modifications (AGPL-3.0 section 5a)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following changes were made to the original VocaMac source by
Tal Epstein in 2026. They are carried in the Git history of
https://github.com/TalEps77/TypeFlow, where each change is attributable to
an individual commit.

  * Hebrew and bilingual dictation, including Hebrew spoken punctuation and
    numbering commands.
  * Dictation Profiles.
  * Snippets.
  * Command Mode for spoken editing commands.
  * An optional transcript cleanup pipeline.
  * A custom Vocabulary of user-supplied terms.
  * Renamed the application to TypeFlow and disabled the inherited in-app
    update checker, which pointed at upstream VocaMac's release feed.

Upstream VocaMac remains the work of its authors and is not responsible for
this fork. Bug reports about TypeFlow belong in this repository's issue
tracker, not upstream's.

